Falsifies `jh7110_pci_express::verification::outbound_window_round_trips_its_size`.

The defect: the size field holds `log2(size)` rather than `log2(size) - 1`, so every window the
bridge decodes is twice the size the caller asked for and overlaps whatever lies above it.

Expected to fail: the harness's assertion that `translated_size_bytes` decodes the size back.

diff --git a/crates/jh7110_pci_express/src/bridge.rs b/crates/jh7110_pci_express/src/bridge.rs
